REGENT OF SEMARANG
PROVINCE OF CENTRAL JAVA
REGIONAL REGULATION OF SEMARANG REGENCY
NUMBER 1 YEAR 2015
CONCERNING
EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF SEMARANG,
Considering : a. that women's empowerment is carried out so that women can actualize their potential optimally to participate in development in accordance with their capacity;
b. that women as national assets who play a role in the process of continuation and creation of quality generations need to receive guarantees for the fulfillment of their rights and protection from acts of violence and discrimination in order to build society, nation and state;
c. that based on Article 12 paragraph (2) letter b of Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government it is stated essentially that women's empowerment is a mandatory affair that must be implemented by regional government;
d. that based on Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government in the Appendix it is stated that the division of government affairs in the field of women's empowerment with one of the sub-affairs is women's protection;
e. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c and letter d it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Empowerment and Protection of Women;
In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 13 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions Within the Province of Central Java;
3. Law Number 67 Year 1958 concerning Changes to the Territorial Boundaries of Salatiga Municipality and Level II Autonomous Region of Semarang (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1958 Number 118, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1652);
4. Law Number 1 Year 1974 concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1974 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3019);
5. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on The Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);
6. Law Number 13 Year 1998 concerning Elderly Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1998 Number 190, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3796);
