19. Government Regulation Number 4 Year 2006 concerning Implementation and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
20. Government Regulation Number 38 Year 2007 concerning Division of Government Affairs between the Government, Provincial Regional Government, and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
21. Presidential Decree Number 88 Year 2002 concerning National Action Plan for the Elimination of Trafficking in Women and Children;
22. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Guidelines for Regional Financial Management, as has been amended several times, most recently by Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 21 Year 2011 concerning Second Amendment to Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Guidelines for Regional Financial Management;
23. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment Number 1 Year 2008 concerning Guidelines for Improving the Quality of Life of Women;
24. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment Number 2 Year 2008 concerning Guidelines for Implementation of Women's Protection;
25. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment Number 4 Year 2008 concerning Guidelines for Empowerment of Community Institutions;
26. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 15 Year 2008 concerning General Guidelines for Implementation of Gender Mainstreaming in the Regions as amended by Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 67 Year 2011 concerning Amendment to Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 15 Year 2008 concerning General Guidelines for Implementation of Gender Mainstreaming in the Regions;
27. Regional Regulation of Semarang Regency Number 16 Year 2008 concerning Government Affairs That Are the Authority of the Regional Government of Semarang Regency (Regional Gazette of Semarang Regency Year 2008 Number 16, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Semarang Regency Number 14);
With Mutual Approval of THE REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF SEMARANG REGENCY And

